        "High Court judges retire at 62 years, while Supreme Court judges retire at 65 years.",
        "The tenure for CAG and Chief Election Commissioner is 6 years or up to 65 years of age, whichever comes first.",
        "Minimum age eligibility for Rajya Sabha is 30 years, whereas for Lok Sabha it is 25 years."
